OL,3,GNEWSAWhat's next for the A303 after
OL,4,AStonehenge tunnel scrapped?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHighway bosses and politicians have
OL,7,Fspent billions of pounds discussing and
OL,8,Fdrawing up plans for a now-scrapped
OL,9,Ftwo-mile (3.2km) tunnel near
OL,10,FStonehenge. But residents who live near
OL,11,Fthe ancient monument say they still
OL,12,Fdesperately need a new road layout to
OL,13,Fease congestion near their homes, so
OL,14,Fwhat is being proposed now?
OL,16,FOne former councillor in Wiltshire has
OL,17,Fcampaigned for years for the A303 to be
OL,18,Ftransformed into a dual carriageway,
OL,19,Fwhile others are calling for traffic to
OL,20,Fbe diverted via a bypass around
OL,21,FSalisbury.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
