OL,3,GNEWSAWhat's next for the A303 after
OL,4,AStonehenge tunnel scrapped?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWiltshire Council said it is working
OL,7,Fwith National Highways on options, such
OL,8,Fas lower speed limits in one nearby
OL,9,Fvillage impacted by congestion.
OL,11,FMeanwhile, National Highways chiefs
OL,12,Fhave said they are "exploring best
OL,13,Fvalue for money solutions", with
OL,14,F"smaller scale improvement projects"
OL,15,Fbeing investigated.
